    },
    "A base tip: the number you'd leave without thinking" : {

    },
    "A café isn't a steakhouse. Xenia groups places into categories, and each one carries its own starting tip and its own things worth asking about. Six are set up for you — edit them, or make your own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A café isn't a steakhouse. Xenia groups places into categories, and each one carries its own starting tip and items worth asking about. Six are set up for you — edit them, delete them, or make your own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cash amount" : {

    },
    "A category holds a base tip and the rules you work at checkout." : {

    },
    "A nudge about %lld min after you arrive here, even if %@ has reminders off. Needs a GPS point and reminders on in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A nudge about %1$lld min after you arrive here, even if %2$@ has reminders off. Needs a GPS point and reminders on in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A percentage" : {

    },
    "A pretend place for this walkthrough. Nothing you do here is saved." : {

    },
    "A saved place inherits its category, then bends it. Xenia can pick the place out for you when you get there, so the tip screen is already set up before you've put the phone down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A saved place inherits its category, then bends it. Xenia can pick the place out for you when you get there, so the tip screen is already set up before you've put your phone down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A score at the neutral mark does nothing. Above lifts the tip, below trims it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A score at the neutral mark keeps the tip amount unchanged. Above the default mark lifts the tip, while below trims it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tip isn't one number. Xenia starts from what you'd normally leave at a place like this one, then moves it for the service you actually got." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A tip isn't one number. Xenia starts from what you'd normally leave at a place like this one, then shifts it for the service you actually got."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About a minute. You can replay it any time from %@." : {

